# Built-in chip kind data (Wave 2C-1): key string, display color, context depth,
# and sort priority for each of the 18 built-in chip kinds registered by
# ChipKindRegistry.EnsureBuiltIns(). Previously scattered across 16 provider
# files (HierarchyChipProvider.cs, BuiltInChipProviders.cs, etc.).
# key: the wire-protocol key (matches ChipKindKeys constants).
# hexColor: CSS hex color for chip pill UI.
# defaultDepth: "path" | "summary" | "full" — context depth default.
# priority: ChipKindRegistry sort order (lower = higher precedence).
RECORD ChipKind KEY key COUNT 18
  key: string
  hexColor: string
  defaultDepth: string
  priority: int
END
